  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A standing wave is formed in a pipe open at one end and closed at the other. The length of the pipe is L and the speed of sound in the pipe is V.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>n is a positive integer.</p>\n<p>What expression is correct about the frequencies of the harmonics in the pipe?</p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{2n-1V}{2L}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{2n-1V}{4L}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{nV}{2L}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{nV}{4L}\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
